======================================================================
STEP 1: symbolic closed form of psi_n^{(2)} from the case sums
======================================================================
case (a) total contribution: 1/3
case (b) total contribution: (n + 1)*(3*n + 1)/(30*n**2)
case (c) total contribution: (n + 1)*(3*n + 1)/(30*n**2)

psi_n^{(2)} CLOSED FORM = (8*n**2 + 4*n + 1)/(15*n**2)
expanded around n=infinity: 8/15 + 4/(15*n) + 1/(15*n**2)

verification against brute force (psi_bruteforce.py, ref=generic):
  n=3: brute=17/27 closed_form=17/27  match=True
  n=4: brute=29/48 closed_form=29/48  match=True
  n=5: brute=221/375 closed_form=221/375  match=True
  n=6: brute=313/540 closed_form=313/540  match=True
  n=7: brute=421/735 closed_form=421/735  match=True
  n=8: brute=109/192 closed_form=109/192  match=True
ALL MATCH: True

